{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play a demo with this brave little guy!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401580/extras/MoWebFront3.png?t=1739578679\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It includes the first two chapters of Snowman Mo!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A narrative, single-player demo just for you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the joy of being brought to life!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn how to run, dance, and roll your way across the snowy mountainside.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle bully baddies and their bully buddies in frantically fun snowball fights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn why Mo has those staples across his face!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet at least five unforgettable characters. This snowman named Sherbert is not one of them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401580/extras/Sherbert3.png?t=1739578679\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(But he'll show up eventually)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3401580?t=1739578679","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3401580?t=1739578679","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401580/bc686c3b9337bc61f0a6ca987440a15b1595dffb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739578679","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401580/bc686c3b9337bc61f0a6ca987440a15b1595dffb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739578679","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play a 